21
00:01:57,780 --> 00:02:02,720
Make sure you have watched the movie
Renegade Immortal: Battle of the Immortal Slayer
before this episode.

22
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:05,000
1 year later

23
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:07,180
Void between Thunder
Celestial Realm fragments

24
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:12,560
Yan Chou
Guard of the Yao Family
Illusory Yin

25
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:12,560
Ru Yun
Yao Lao's cousin
Early stage Ascendant

26
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:12,560
Yao Luo
Yao Family's branch member
Peak Late stage Ascendant

27
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:27,070
He lasted 13 days.

28
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:29,630
Better than the ones before him.

29
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:31,030
Young Master,

30
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:33,830
this guy is already at his last breath.

31
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:35,110
Uncle Chou,

32
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:38,240
it looks like we need to catch an Illusory Yin cultivator next time

33
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:40,230
so I can play a few more days.

34
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:41,270
Alright.

35
00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:42,310
Cousin,

36
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:45,830
this guy still has a few swords on him.

37
00:02:47,440 --> 00:02:48,550
I won't forget.

38
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:50,790
They're all yours.

39
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:52,790
Not to mention these 9 swords,

40
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:55,510
everything in this Thunder Celestial Realm

41
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:57,310
can become mine

42
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:59,110
if I wish.

43
00:02:59,720 --> 00:03:01,470
Cousin, you're from the Yao Family,

44
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:03,430
of course you can get anything you want.

45
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:07,190
I can't hold on any longer...

46
00:03:13,920 --> 00:03:15,610
If you want my artifacts, take them.

47
00:03:15,720 --> 00:03:17,390
Why would you humiliate me to this extent ?

48
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:20,030
Even if I become a ghost,

49
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:22,350
I will never let you off !

50
00:03:24,040 --> 00:03:25,470
You're overestimating yourself.

51
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:31,970
A member of the Li Family,

52
00:03:32,160 --> 00:03:33,550
even in death...

53
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:35,350
will keep its dignity !

54
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:42,550
Break.

55
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:54,510
Annihilation

56
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,190
Restriction Heart !

57
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,750
Now die !

58
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:30,590
Brother Xu...

59
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:33,310
I won't be able to give you

60
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:36,350
my Restriction Heart anymore.

61
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:38,910
Let me see

62
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:40,870
where exactly

63
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:44,110
you got those 9 celestial swords.

64
00:04:44,520 --> 00:04:45,270
Cousin,

65
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,870
hurry up.

66
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,430
Young Master, retreat !

67
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:26,950
Who gave you the qualifications

68
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:29,550
to hurt my friend ?

69
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:33,670
Spatial Bending !?

70
00:05:34,520 --> 00:05:37,640
I know all the Corporeal Yang cultivators who entered the Thunder Celestial Realm,

71
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:39,070
but who is he !?

72
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:44,870
Brother Xu...

73
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:48,190
Help me

74
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:50,310
to kill them.

75
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:56,320
Wang Lin's avatar
Corporeal Yang

76
00:06:08,960 --> 00:06:10,710
If he has such a powerful friend,

77
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:12,110
why didn't he say so earlier !?

78
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:31,150
How long did you chase my friend ?

79
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:32,470
Senior, let me speak !

80
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,630
It was the Yao Young Master...

81
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:36,510
How long !?

82
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:37,760
Thir...

83
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,470
Thirteen days...

84
00:06:39,960 --> 00:06:40,350
Stop !

85
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:44,240
This is for the first day.

86
00:06:45,440 --> 00:06:46,410
The second day !

87
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:49,310
The third day !

88
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:53,040
Stop !

89
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:54,790
The fourth day !

90
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:56,390
Fifth...

91
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:57,760
Sixth...

92
00:06:58,080 --> 00:06:58,630
Seventh !

93
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,550
Thirteenth !

94
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:06,200
Junior,

95
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,960
you killed a member of the Yao Family.

96
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:12,070
The Yao Family will exterminate your entire family !

97
00:07:14,080 --> 00:07:15,230
Do you recognize him ?

98
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:21,350
The aura of the Yao Family's direct bloodline ?

99
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,070
You...!

100
00:07:30,440 --> 00:07:30,950
Brother Li,

101
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:32,350
I will give you an opportunity.

102
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:35,520
Whether you can reach Illusory Yin

103
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:37,310
depends on your luck.

104
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:45,040
Cave Residence
Thunder Celestial Realm

105
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:47,050
Li Yuan has been stuck at Peak Ascendant for years

106
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:48,430
not because he lacks talent

107
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:50,790
but because he lacked origin energy.

108
00:07:52,280 --> 00:07:53,750
By infusing him with origin energy today,

109
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,190
he may be able to breakthrough.

110
00:08:00,440 --> 00:08:01,390
In such a short time,

111
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:04,480
I was hunted by an all-powerful Nirvana Cleanser.

112
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:07,120
Had I chosen to flee and avoid the fight that day,

113
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:09,200
I would have likely become a blood slave

114
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:11,160
or have died with my Dao exterminated.

115
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:13,470
To slay this Immortal,

116
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:15,070
I had to narrowly escape death

117
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:18,590
and I obtained this Corporeal Yang cultivation.

118
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,070
A defensive formation of this scale

119
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,230
isn't something I could've done before.

120
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:32,390
The Corporeal Yang realm

121
00:08:32,680 --> 00:08:34,160
is not only a higher cultivation level

122
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:37,360
but it also grants a higher mastery over the laws of the world.

123
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:43,920
Refining an entire Celestial Realm fragment into an artifact

124
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:46,030
really made this trip worthwile.

125
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:51,920
Thunder Celestial Realm
Fragment Stamp

126
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:54,510
Wan'er...

127
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,190
Wait for me.

128
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:59,590
I will definitely go to Planet Dong Lin.

129
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:02,310
Even if there is only a sliver of a chance to awaken you,

130
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,630
I will not let it go.

131
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,270
Before going to Dong Lin,

132
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:13,950
I still need to master more celestial spells and artifacts.

133
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:18,160
This object is formed from half of the Blood Ancestor's blood body,

134
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:19,190
it's very powerful.

135
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:21,360
If I refine it a bit,

136
00:09:22,040 --> 00:09:22,870
it may save my life

137
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:24,030
at a critical moment.

138
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:36,830
This artifact isn't ordinary.

139
00:09:37,920 --> 00:09:39,030
I have tried several times

140
00:09:39,520 --> 00:09:41,150
but I can't imprint my Divine Sense on it.

141
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,880
Could there be another secret to it ?

142
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:49,390
When I obtained this bone,

143
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:51,830
it was with these celestial swords.

144
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:04,360
As expected !

145
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:11,040
The celestial swords and the beast bone

146
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:13,940
are able to make a faintly perceptible formation.

147
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,630
If not for this nested formation,

148
00:10:16,520 --> 00:10:17,830
my Divine Sense would have no way in.

149
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:35,280
A restriction world was hidden in the sword ?

150
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:58,790
This restriction is brilliant,

151
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:00,390
it's unlike anything I've ever seen.

152
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:02,270
The one who set it is no ordinary Celestial.

153
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:04,450
To claim this artifact,

154
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:05,830
I must find the formation's eye

155
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:07,270
to break the restriction.

156
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:20,750
I found it !

157
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:42,950
All these restrictions

158
00:11:43,640 --> 00:11:44,840
are chained together

159
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:46,080
in a restriction matrix.

160
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:48,390
To imprint my Divine Sense,

161
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:50,070
I need to

162
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:52,390
break all the restrictions at once !

163
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:54,080
Fall !

164
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:23,040
Withered Dao Pair

165
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:24,510
According to the memory of the previous Divine Sense imprint,

166
00:12:24,680 --> 00:12:25,600
this thing

167
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:26,910
is called the Withered Dao Pair.

168
00:12:27,560 --> 00:12:29,230
It's a true celestial artifact.

169
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:32,270
It was damaged in the war against the Ancient Gods.

170
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:34,110
After its master died,

171
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:36,270
it wasn't fully repaired.

172
00:12:38,880 --> 00:12:40,240
Even in its damaged state,

173
00:12:40,400 --> 00:12:41,830
its power is still astonishing.

174
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:47,070
It's one of my most powerful artifacts right now.

175
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:52,760
Yao

176
00:12:50,960 --> 00:12:52,030
Yao Family of Allheaven...

177
00:12:53,280 --> 00:12:54,550
Ever since I killed the Blood Ancestor,

178
00:12:55,280 --> 00:12:56,710
a blood feud was created.

179
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:01,150
Another talisman ?

180
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:03,750
This talisman

181
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:06,550
is extremely similar to the one I obtained from Xu Fenghan.

182
00:13:06,580 --> 00:13:08,640
Note: Xu Fengshan, Illusory Yin from Planet Dong Lin (episode 149)

183
00:13:08,680 --> 00:13:09,880
Origin energy fluctuations !

184
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:11,840
If not for my improved cultivation,

185
00:13:11,880 --> 00:13:13,080
I wouldn't have detected it.

186
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:15,190
This should be a special artifact

187
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:17,350
but I don't know how to use it for now.

188
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,390
Collection Pavilion...

189
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:28,920
So this Illusory Yin Elder entered the Thunder Celestial Realm

190
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:31,430
to escort a member of the Yao Family to this pavilion

191
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:33,350
to obtain celestial spells.

192
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:37,520
This pavilion was personally built by the Thunder Celestial Emperor

193
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,360
and stores countless celestial spells.

194
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:42,550
Now, the four great ancient families with a Celestial bloodline

195
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:44,390
have joined forces to seal this place

196
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:46,430
and only allow those with a Celestial bloodline to enter

197
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:48,070
in search of opportunities.

198
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:50,660
The Yao Family

199
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:52,630
is one of them.

200
00:14:00,120 --> 00:14:00,670
Brother Xu,

201
00:14:01,640 --> 00:14:02,270
thank you.

202
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:05,870
But my Origin Soul can't withstand that much origin energy.

203
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:07,350
It seems that

204
00:14:08,040 --> 00:14:09,720
I'm not fated to reach Illusory Yin.

205
00:14:11,800 --> 00:14:13,360
Brother Li, don't underestimate yourself.

206
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:16,520
The origin energy within you will keep nourishing your Origin Soul.

207
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:18,030
When it's fully absorbed,

208
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:19,710
you will reach Illusory Yin.

209
00:14:20,640 --> 00:14:21,450
That day

210
00:14:22,040 --> 00:14:23,360
may come sooner or later.

211
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:24,960
Success lies in perseverance.

212
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:28,130
I'm returning what belongs to you.

213
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:32,890
Keep them safe.

214
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,590
These artifacts and celestial jades

215
00:14:34,800 --> 00:14:36,170
will also help your cultivation.

216
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:39,900
This is a Restriction-Breaking Ancient Mirror,

217
00:14:38,800 --> 00:14:41,760
Restriction-Breaking
Ancient Mirror

218
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:41,560
there are very few of these left.

219
00:14:42,040 --> 00:14:43,790
If you ever need to break a restriction quickly,

220
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:45,790
it may be of help to you.

221
00:14:47,400 --> 00:14:48,670
I can no longer see through

222
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:50,430
Brother Xu's cultivation.

223
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:53,310
As for slaying that Immortal...

224
00:14:54,880 --> 00:14:56,690
It was only possible thanks to Brother Li's restrictions.

225
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:58,150
Although the Blood Ancestor isn't dead yet,

226
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:00,110
he no longer poses a threat.

227
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:01,820
Brother Li,

228
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:04,760
I wish to go to a place called the Collection Pavilion

229
00:15:04,800 --> 00:15:06,040
to obtain celestial spells.

230
00:15:06,760 --> 00:15:08,720
But this place is sealed by restrictions.

231
00:15:09,240 --> 00:15:12,160
Brother Li is far more familiar with the Thunder Celestial Realm than I am.

232
00:15:12,600 --> 00:15:13,800
Do you want to come with me ?

233
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:15,890
I will follow Brother Xu

234
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:17,310
wherever you go.

235
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:21,040
Celestial Guiding Palace
Thunder Celestial Realm

236
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:19,630
Brother Xu,

237
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:21,760
The Collection Pavilion is to the southwest

238
00:15:21,800 --> 00:15:23,600
and there are several ancient Celestial ruins nearby.

239
00:15:23,680 --> 00:15:24,880
Do you want to explore them too ?

240
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:26,970
If Brother Li thinks they're worth visiting,

241
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,360
then the more opportunities,

242
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:29,470
the better.

243
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:36,270
This rundown place

244
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:38,120
Celestial Welcoming
Palace

245
00:15:36,520 --> 00:15:37,830
has probably been cleaned up already.

246
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:40,310
What's there to look around for ?

247
00:15:40,880 --> 00:15:42,160
This Celestial Welcoming Palace

248
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:44,510
seems to be a place where ancient Celestials traded.

249
00:15:45,160 --> 00:15:46,480
Brother Xu's guess is right.

250
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:48,110
According to ancient records,

251
00:15:48,480 --> 00:15:49,680
in these kinds of Celestial markets,

252
00:15:49,880 --> 00:15:51,430
the largest shop is always to the east.

253
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:03,190
My Divine Sense found nothing unusual.

254
00:16:04,960 --> 00:16:05,550
See ?

255
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:07,310
Not even a single hair left.

256
00:16:10,160 --> 00:16:10,590
Brother Xu,

257
00:16:11,160 --> 00:16:12,920
please strike this spot with full force.

258
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:21,990
There really was a hidden formation.

259
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:24,990
It's a pity this formation is too old,

260
00:16:25,640 --> 00:16:26,990
its celestial spiritual energy is gone,

261
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:28,150
it's a dead formation.

262
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:30,240
Not bad.

263
00:16:31,080 --> 00:16:32,310
But my Li Family's restrictions

264
00:16:32,400 --> 00:16:34,110
can restore this dead formation.

265
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:40,830
Li Yuan really is

266
00:16:41,320 --> 00:16:42,430
a restriction prodigy.

267
00:16:43,880 --> 00:16:46,080
If he were with me in the Rain Celestial Realm,

268
00:16:46,840 --> 00:16:48,110
maybe he could have reverse-engineered

269
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:50,430
the illusory palm strike.

270
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:55,390
I did it !

271
00:17:10,480 --> 00:17:11,590
The spirit of the formation ?

272
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:14,310
This is the first time this formation has been opened !

273
00:17:15,400 --> 00:17:16,770
Once this beam of light disperses,

274
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:18,060
we will be able to enter.

275
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:19,840
This formation is making too much of a commotion,

276
00:17:19,920 --> 00:17:21,110
I'm afraid it will attract unwanted attention.

277
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:23,600
A heavenly phenomenon !

278
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:24,880
